### Crear una jornada (con SC002) — resultado esperado (200, la jornada con sus franjas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/saveSchedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleName": "Lunes a viernes",
  "shifts": [
    { "weekday": 2, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "weekday": 3, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "weekday": 4, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "weekday": 5, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "17:00" },
    { "weekday": 6, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "12:00" },
    { "weekday": 6, "startTime": "13:00", "endTime": "17:00" }
  ]
}

### Editar una jornada visible (con SC003) — las personas que la tienen reciben el setting 18 nuevo
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/saveSchedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": 930,
  "scheduleName": "Lunes a sábado",
  "shifts": [
    { "weekday": 2, "startTime": "07:00", "endTime": "18:00" },
    { "weekday": 7, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "12:00" }
  ]
}

### Hora con formato inválido → 400 (validación del modelo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/saveSchedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleName": "Mala",
  "shifts": [ { "weekday": 2, "startTime": "8:00", "endTime": "25:00" } ]
}

### Jornada de otra organización → 400 "No tiene acceso a la jornada"
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/saveSchedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": 1,
  "scheduleName": "Ajena",
  "shifts": [ { "weekday": 2, "startTime": "08:00", "endTime": "17:00" } ]
}
